  return svgWrap('sev','Gaps by design area — '+esc(a.name), 'Not-met checks per CAF design area and WAF pillar in the landing zone assessment, split high (red) / medium (amber) / low (blue). Management-group benchmark gaps are listed separately in the assessment register. Click a bar to open the register.', out, w, 12+areas.length*rowH+8);
